{"id": 63455, "date": "2025-12-27T04:00:44", "date_gmt": "2025-12-27T12:00:44", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=63455"}, "modified": "2026-08-04T21:30:39", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-05T04:30:39", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-27-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/27/kingdom-of-days-december-27-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 27"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p><strong>1967:\u00a0</strong>The Castiles play a show at Le Teendezvous in New Shrewsbury, New Jersey.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6751\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1967-1227/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1967-1227.jpg?fit=671%2C774&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"671,774\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1967-1227\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1967-1227.jpg?fit=671%2C774&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6751 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1967-1227.jpg?resize=671%2C774&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"671\" height=\"774\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1967-1227.jpg?w=671&amp;ssl=1 671w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1967-1227.jpg?resize=260%2C300&amp;ssl=1 260w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 671px) 100vw, 671px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1968:\u00a0</strong>Earth plays four sets at Le Teendezvous in New Shrewsbury.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6753\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1968-1227/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1968-1227.jpg?fit=175%2C250&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"175,250\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1968-1227\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1968-1227.jpg?fit=175%2C250&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6753 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1968-1227.jpg?resize=175%2C250&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"175\" height=\"250\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1973:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the E Street Band kick off a four-night/two-shows-nightly stand at The Main Point in Bryn Mawr, Pennsylvania.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6754\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1973-1227/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1973-1227.jpg?fit=300%2C192&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"300,192\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1973-1227\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1973-1227.jpg?fit=300%2C192&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6754 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1973-1227.jpg?resize=300%2C192&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"192\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1975:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the band play their first of a four-night year-closing stand at the Tower Theater in Philadelphia. Tonight sees the tour premiere of &#8220;Back in the U.S.A.&#8221; and the last full-band &#8220;Lost in the Flood&#8221; for 25 years.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zLwM0wC1Kg4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MPcdBExC2sA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent&#038;listType=playlist&#038;list=PLJTyL9twk3zA1LKH8_99vA483OppBfqkI\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23441\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1975-12-27/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-27.png?fit=2594%2C1362&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2594,1362\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1975-12-27\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-27.png?fit=758%2C398&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23441 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-27.png?resize=758%2C398&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"398\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-27.png?w=2594&amp;ssl=1 2594w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-27.png?resize=300%2C158&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-27.png?resize=1024%2C538&amp;